Director Chong!

276
00:17:21.498 --> 00:17:23.876
But To Kyung was really not the intruder?

277
00:17:24.752 --> 00:17:26.670
So how many attackers were there?

278
00:17:26.754 --> 00:17:30.382
It looks like we have
a new intruder around every corner.

279
00:17:30.466 --> 00:17:31.800
Is everything right this time?

280
00:17:31.884 --> 00:17:33.635
- Mr. Pak.
- What?

281
00:17:34.803 --> 00:17:35.971
Let's say...

282
00:17:37.931 --> 00:17:41.393
you believe someone pulled you out of hell.

283
00:17:44.354 --> 00:17:45.439
And then it turns out...

284
00:17:46.857 --> 00:17:49.276
that this particular person sent you to hell.

285
00:17:51.904 --> 00:17:53.489
What would you do?

286
00:17:54.490 --> 00:17:55.532
I would burn bridges.

287
00:17:56.325 --> 00:17:59.495
when they hurt you
best to burn bridges.

288
00:18:00.079 --> 00:18:01.413
And if it's a dead person?

289
00:18:01.497 --> 00:18:02.956
That's all decided. There is no problem.

290
00:18:03.040 --> 00:18:04.541
But who is it about?

291
00:18:06.460 --> 00:18:07.503
Choo Jung Suk.

292
00:18:08.754 --> 00:18:09.838
Maybe she…

293
00:18:11.882 --> 00:18:13.842
killed To Hee's parents.

294
00:18:14.384 --> 00:18:15.761
Hold on.

295
00:18:15.844 --> 00:18:17.971
That is, how could she possibly have killed them?

296
00:18:18.055 --> 00:18:19.807
Did she kill them or not?

297
00:18:19.890 --> 00:18:21.683
These are No Suk Min's words, so it remains to be seen.

298
00:18:21.767 --> 00:18:22.601
What...

299
00:18:22.684 --> 00:18:24.728
Did he tell you that before he died?

300
00:18:25.771 --> 00:18:27.106
Probably, he is a real villain.

301
00:18:27.189 --> 00:18:29.066
He was evil to the end.

302
00:18:31.276 --> 00:18:33.987
So that's why you're so upset.

303
00:18:34.780 --> 00:18:36.323
I think everything is confused.

304
00:18:36.865 --> 00:18:38.784
It's too scary to unearth the truth

305
00:18:38.867 --> 00:18:41.245
but she is too important
to simply ignore it.

306
00:18:41.745 --> 00:18:43.122
But if I were her…

307
00:18:45.124 --> 00:18:46.083
What?

308
00:18:46.166 --> 00:18:49.503
I would deny it and move on.

309
00:18:53.924 --> 00:18:54.967
In general, it is possible

310
00:18:58.595 --> 00:18:59.680
to hide this?

311
00:19:00.681 --> 00:19:03.725
It would hurt sometimes
like a rolling pin under the skin.

312
00:19:04.726 --> 00:19:05.602
It's the same

313
00:19:06.562 --> 00:19:08.230
i would choose imperfect happiness

314
00:19:08.313 --> 00:19:09.815
and not the painful truth.

315
00:19:25.455 --> 00:19:28.542
There should already be articles
about the sales rating of our new product.

316
00:19:33.463 --> 00:19:36.884
BODY HEAD NO SUK MINA
NOT FOUND YET

317
00:19:36.967 --> 00:19:39.845
My mother didn't believe in anything
not to mention religion.

318
00:19:39.928 --> 00:19:42.973
But she started walking every day
to confession after their death!

319
00:19:43.056 --> 00:19:44.266
Why do you think?

320
00:19:44.349 --> 00:19:46.602
What was she so desperate to wash away?

321
00:19:46.685 --> 00:19:48.812
What exactly was she so afraid of?

322
00:19:56.695 --> 00:19:59.531
ACCIDENT AT PRODUCTION
"MIRE ELECTRONICS"

323
00:20:10.292 --> 00:20:14.129
"ELECTRONIC MIRE" RECOGNIZED FOR THE FIRST TIME
ACCIDENT AT PRODUCTION

324
00:20:25.390 --> 00:20:26.808
{\an8}CHU CHONG SUK'S HEAD IS ON HIS KNEES

325
00:20:26.892 --> 00:20:29.728
{\an8}<i>I will expose everything.</i>

326
00:20:31.521 --> 00:20:33.482
<i>How dare you blackmail me?</i>

327
00:20:33.565 --> 00:20:34.608
<i>What do you want?</i>

328
00:20:35.609 --> 00:20:36.526
<i>Just wait.</i>

329
00:20:37.361 --> 00:20:40.656
<i>Everything won't go the way you want it to.</i>

330
00:20:40.739 --> 00:20:44.201
All signs of attention and love,
which she gave you

331
00:20:44.868 --> 00:20:47.704
were actually her ticket to heaven.

332
00:20:47.788 --> 00:20:49.706
Yes, yes!

333
00:20:49.790 --> 00:20:52.626
From the death of your parents
more than 20 years have passed.

334
00:20:52.709 --> 00:20:55.087
You can no longer honor
the anniversary of their death.

335
00:20:55.170 --> 00:20:56.588
Just celebrate your birthday.

336
00:21:20.445 --> 00:21:24.199
How long have you worked for Ms. Chu?

337
00:21:24.283 --> 00:21:27.202
I worked for her for about 20 years
to work with you.

338
00:21:29.037 --> 00:21:30.580
you were with her

339
00:21:30.664 --> 00:21:34.543
when she admitted to the accident
at the production of "Mire Electronics"

340
00:21:35.043 --> 00:21:36.962
first time?

341
00:21:37.045 --> 00:21:38.088
Yes.

342
00:21:38.171 --> 00:21:41.675
I just started then
to work as her secretary.

343
00:21:47.389 --> 00:21:50.392
When did she start using a wand?

344
00:21:52.436 --> 00:21:54.521
She already used it
when we met

345
00:21:55.355 --> 00:21:58.567
It was sometime when you met.

346
00:21:59.776 --> 00:22:01.361
At your parents' funeral.

347
00:22:07.326 --> 00:22:08.285
Something

348
00:22:09.244 --> 00:22:10.912
then what happened

349
00:22:12.998 --> 00:22:15.208
She never explained why.

350
00:22:15.292 --> 00:22:18.211
We were only told that it is a chronic disease.

351
00:22:50.035 --> 00:22:51.161
Ku Vone.

352
00:22:53.080 --> 00:22:54.873
What should I do?

353
00:23:11.431 --> 00:23:14.267
Ms. Chu did not approve of what I honored

354
00:23:15.227 --> 00:23:17.604
the anniversary of the death of parents
on his birthday.

355
00:23:19.356 --> 00:23:21.024
She kept insisting

356
00:23:21.108 --> 00:23:22.609
so that I forget the unhappy past.

357
00:23:34.538 --> 00:23:36.164
If what No Suk Min said is true

358
00:23:40.669 --> 00:23:43.004
and Mrs. Chu really cheated me,

359
00:23:46.216 --> 00:23:47.676
then what should i do?

360
00:23:50.971 --> 00:23:52.264
seems to

361
00:23:53.056 --> 00:23:54.641
like i'm trapped

362
00:24:02.065 --> 00:24:03.233
Do you remember

363
00:24:04.234 --> 00:24:06.820
the message that Choo Jung Suk
sent you before death?

364
00:24:10.949 --> 00:24:12.325
<i>She wrote that she loves you.</i>

365
00:24:12.409 --> 00:24:13.368
I LOVE YOU SO HEE

366
00:24:16.037 --> 00:24:19.374
Even dying in agony

367
00:24:21.418 --> 00:24:25.005
she wrote you
to express your love.

368
00:24:30.468 --> 00:24:31.636
In the face of death

369
00:24:33.638 --> 00:24:37.100
people are most honest with themselves.

370
00:24:41.688 --> 00:24:44.107
This is what I observed

371
00:24:44.191 --> 00:24:45.442
the past 200 years.

372
00:24:51.239 --> 00:24:53.074
You are right.

373
00:24:59.289 --> 00:25:01.082
It's a pity that the dead won't say anything anymore.

374
00:25:01.833 --> 00:25:03.710
One conversation with her

375
00:25:04.419 --> 00:25:05.879
I would decide everything.

376
00:25:06.796 --> 00:25:07.881
Yes?

377
00:25:21.478 --> 00:25:22.479
There is a way…

378
00:25:24.522 --> 00:25:27.442
get the news he Ms. Chu.

379
00:25:41.414 --> 00:25:43.375
How to get a message from Choo Jung-suk here?

380
00:25:43.458 --> 00:25:45.293
She was close to the priest here

381
00:25:45.377 --> 00:25:47.712
named Father Michael.

382
00:25:48.213 --> 00:25:49.214
Maybe he is

383
00:25:50.257 --> 00:25:52.050
can tell us something.

384
00:25:53.009 --> 00:25:54.511
How should he know anything?

385
00:25:58.515 --> 00:25:59.391
father

386
00:26:04.187 --> 00:26:05.480
Of course.

387
00:26:05.563 --> 00:26:06.439
Thanks to confession.

388
00:26:07.065 --> 00:26:09.526
Long time no see, To Hee.

389
00:26:13.029 --> 00:26:14.823
This is my husband.

390
00:26:22.747 --> 00:26:24.332
I am Father Michael.

391
00:26:25.250 --> 00:26:26.209
Jung Koo Won.

392
00:26:28.795 --> 00:26:30.213
He speaks quite strangely.

393
00:26:30.297 --> 00:26:32.173
Probably, he is not from local places.

394
00:26:35.552 --> 00:26:36.636
by the way

395
00:26:36.720 --> 00:26:39.014
how was Mrs. Chu's funeral?

396
00:26:39.097 --> 00:26:41.766
I was a volunteer in Mongolia
and could not be present.

397
00:26:43.143 --> 00:26:44.686
It was an eventful day.

398
00:26:44.769 --> 00:26:47.147
I read about it in the newspapers.

399
00:26:47.731 --> 00:26:49.649
Heard Suk Min died.

400
00:26:52.235 --> 00:26:54.612
It is for this reason that I am here.

401
00:26:54.696 --> 00:26:57.407
Before he died, he told me something strange.

402
00:27:04.039 --> 00:27:04.873
Could you please

403
00:27:05.707 --> 00:27:07.917
let us talk alone?

404
00:27:10.211 --> 00:27:11.713
Can you wait outside the door?

405
00:27:14.799 --> 00:27:17.177
Call me if anything happens.

406
00:27:17.260 --> 00:27:18.094
Good.

407
00:27:44.204 --> 00:27:46.289
I have a bad feeling about him.

408
00:27:53.046 --> 00:27:55.256
Looks like the time has finally come.

409
00:28:01.429 --> 00:28:02.931
Ms. Chu…

410
00:28:04.974 --> 00:28:07.394
I felt guilty until the very end...

411
00:28:13.650 --> 00:28:16.319
because she was not completely frank with you.

412
00:28:26.496 --> 00:28:27.622
father

413
00:28:28.373 --> 00:28:30.208
I won't be able to go to heaven, will I?

414
00:28:32.460 --> 00:28:35.171
But there is something I fear more…

415
00:28:36.756 --> 00:28:38.466
than go to hell.

416
00:28:39.759 --> 00:28:41.177
I'm afraid…

417
00:28:43.847 --> 00:28:45.765
that she will not forgive me.

418
00:28:46.641 --> 00:28:50.687
Your own mind has locked you in hell.

419
00:28:51.604 --> 00:28:53.273
Time to confess and tell the truth

420
00:28:54.441 --> 00:28:55.859
to free yourself.

421
00:28:57.569 --> 00:28:58.778
True...

422
00:29:06.035 --> 00:29:08.037
If I can't find the courage

423
00:29:09.205 --> 00:29:11.124
before death...

424
00:29:13.460 --> 00:29:14.419
and…

425
00:29:17.714 --> 00:29:19.924
if To Hee asks what the truth is

426
00:29:21.718 --> 00:29:22.761
then I ask…

427
00:29:25.972 --> 00:29:28.057
tell her you

428
00:29:36.983 --> 00:29:39.694
Was that your order?

429
00:29:40.820 --> 00:29:43.740
You ordered tampering
state measurement data

430
00:29:43.823 --> 00:29:44.949
work environment?

431
00:29:45.033 --> 00:29:46.075
It is only for a short time.

432
00:29:46.576 --> 00:29:50.079
I will replace the dust collectors,
I have just finally received the investment.

433
00:29:50.747 --> 00:29:51.915
"Just for a while"?

434
00:29:52.540 --> 00:29:55.126
Meanwhile, people can die.

435
00:29:55.210 --> 00:29:59.422
You say you are ready to trade
people's lives for investment?

436
00:29:59.506 --> 00:30:01.299
Everything has its time.

437
00:30:02.967 --> 00:30:04.761
Certain risks are acceptable

438
00:30:05.595 --> 00:30:07.430
for higher purposes.

439
00:30:07.514 --> 00:30:09.849
But you are not the one taking the risk!

440
00:30:10.517 --> 00:30:13.311
By doing so, you are sacrificing employees,
who trusted you

441
00:30:13.853 --> 00:30:17.982
for your personal success!

442
00:30:19.442 --> 00:30:21.945
Our company is at a crossroads.

443
00:30:22.904 --> 00:30:25.740
This is significant
investment offer - a rarity!

444
00:30:27.325 --> 00:30:28.576
Do nothing.

445
00:30:28.660 --> 00:30:29.744
Every goal

446
00:30:30.578 --> 00:30:32.038
requires certain collateral losses.

447
00:30:32.121 --> 00:30:33.957
You left me no choice.

448
00:30:34.457 --> 00:30:37.001
I will expose everything.

449
00:30:46.344 --> 00:30:48.263
How dare you blackmail me?

450
00:30:49.180 --> 00:30:50.306
What do you want?

451
00:30:51.099 --> 00:30:52.058
Money?

452
00:30:52.141 --> 00:30:55.645
I only want you to take
take responsibility

453
00:30:55.728 --> 00:30:58.523
and made sure that this would not happen again.

454
00:30:58.606 --> 00:31:01.985
You left the company and ran away.

455
00:31:02.569 --> 00:31:03.903
Who gave you that right?

456
00:31:06.656 --> 00:31:09.951
This is <i>my </i>company.

457
00:31:10.034 --> 00:31:12.537
You did not build it yourself.

458
00:31:12.620 --> 00:31:14.914
It is built on blood, sweat and tears

459
00:31:14.998 --> 00:31:17.041
everyone who works here!

460
00:31:17.125 --> 00:31:19.335
Dear, it's okay.

461
00:31:19.419 --> 00:31:20.879
We have almost no time left.

462
00:31:20.962 --> 00:31:22.422
Just wait.

463
00:31:22.505 --> 00:31:26.175
Everything will not go as you want.

464
00:31:57.540 --> 00:32:00.793
My wife will send detailed documents
to your office.

465
00:32:00.877 --> 00:32:03.129
The lives of hundreds of people are in danger.

466
00:32:03.212 --> 00:32:05.131
This must be made public.

467
00:32:09.636 --> 00:32:11.930
After what I've been through
to build a company

468
00:32:13.181 --> 00:32:15.141
how dare you destroy her?

469
00:32:23.066 --> 00:32:23.900
Beloved.

470
00:32:23.983 --> 00:32:25.693
I have to take care of it

471
00:32:25.777 --> 00:32:27.070
before i die

472
00:32:30.740 --> 00:32:33.076
I will stop you even if it kills me.

473
00:32:33.660 --> 00:32:35.411
By hand

474
00:32:51.219 --> 00:32:53.638
Time, dear.

475
00:32:58.184 --> 00:32:59.185
Don't worry.

476
00:33:00.436 --> 00:33:02.814
I will have time to see To Hee before I die.

477
00:33:12.490 --> 00:33:13.658
No!

478
00:33:50.945 --> 00:33:53.906
TO HEE'S DEAR DAUGHTER

479
00:34:01.247 --> 00:34:02.498
I'll come back

480
00:34:04.042 --> 00:34:05.043
Beloved.

481
00:34:06.794 --> 00:34:07.754
Beloved.

482
00:34:57.887 --> 00:34:59.722
Please save my wife.

483
00:35:06.562 --> 00:35:08.397
You can't make a wish.

484
00:35:08.898 --> 00:35:11.067
You are ten years ago
already made a deal with me.

485
00:35:12.068 --> 00:35:14.862
Please, I can't leave To Hee alone.

486
00:35:17.073 --> 00:35:20.159
You will die of a heart attack.

487
00:35:27.166 --> 00:35:28.459
To Hee

488
00:35:29.794 --> 00:35:31.003
To Hee

489
00:36:22.471 --> 00:36:23.514
What is…

490
00:36:26.601 --> 00:36:28.519
did you commit

491
00:36:31.606 --> 00:36:32.857
Judging from your view,

492
00:36:33.691 --> 00:36:35.860
I see you are desperate for something.

493
00:36:38.446 --> 00:36:39.530
of what

494
00:36:40.573 --> 00:36:43.367
Do you want me to fulfill your wish?

495
00:36:45.036 --> 00:36:47.496
I can do it
your most cherished wish

496
00:36:48.080 --> 00:36:49.665
and give you the life you want.

497
00:36:49.749 --> 00:36:51.375
But you will repay me in ten years.

498
00:36:52.668 --> 00:36:54.170
In ten years

499
00:36:55.922 --> 00:36:57.340
your soul will end up in hell.

500
00:37:07.600 --> 00:37:08.434
You probably…

501
00:37:14.190 --> 00:37:15.358
the devil

502
00:37:53.354 --> 00:37:54.855
Ms. Chu

503
00:37:55.439 --> 00:37:58.567
she regretted that night all her life.

504
00:38:00.194 --> 00:38:02.363
She always blamed herself
in what happened

505
00:38:02.446 --> 00:38:05.700
thought that everything would be different
if she hadn't followed them.

506
00:38:33.394 --> 00:38:34.353
What did he say?

507
00:38:35.730 --> 00:38:37.440
But Suk Min lied.

508
00:38:39.984 --> 00:38:42.445
Then why are you so upset?

509
00:38:44.322 --> 00:38:46.824
I feel bad, even for a moment
doubted Mrs. Chu.

510
00:38:49.201 --> 00:38:50.036
Come on.

511
00:39:22.985 --> 00:39:24.612
I will wash and go to bed.

512
00:39:25.571 --> 00:39:26.572
To Hee

513
00:39:30.951 --> 00:39:31.786
Don't worry.

514
00:39:31.869 --> 00:39:33.621
I'm just tired.

515
00:40:15.746 --> 00:40:16.914
<i>The event of that night</i>

516
00:40:19.291 --> 00:40:21.919
<i>changed Mrs. Chu's attitude to life forever.</i>

517
00:40:23.587 --> 00:40:25.965
<i>A meeting with a real devil...</i>

518
00:40:28.384 --> 00:40:30.719
<i>didn't let her become a devil herself.</i>

519
00:42:12.530 --> 00:42:13.531
are you going somewhere

520
00:42:15.115 --> 00:42:16.784
Yes, sign the agreement.

521
00:42:19.912 --> 00:42:22.248
I usually work better at night.

522
00:42:29.880 --> 00:42:30.798
go to sleep

523
00:42:31.549 --> 00:42:32.508
Don't wait for me.

524
00:43:35.821 --> 00:43:37.281
you are back

525
00:43:38.032 --> 00:43:39.825
You probably understood who I am...

526
00:43:42.578 --> 00:43:44.371
because it doesn't surprise you.

527
00:43:44.455 --> 00:43:45.873
Why should I be surprised?

528
00:43:46.874 --> 00:43:48.208
your existence

529
00:43:49.084 --> 00:43:52.046
proves the existence of God.

530
00:43:52.630 --> 00:43:53.922
Do you think God protects you?

531
00:43:56.675 --> 00:43:58.636
Actually, I was waiting for you.

532
00:44:01.388 --> 00:44:02.931
Leave To Hee.

533
00:44:06.602 --> 00:44:08.312
You are dangerous for her.

534
00:44:09.897 --> 00:44:12.024
You can't stay with her.

535
00:44:12.107 --> 00:44:13.567
Perhaps the profession is to blame,

536
00:44:13.651 --> 00:44:15.778
but you seem
You are biased towards me.

537
00:44:16.695 --> 00:44:17.821
I do no harm.

538
00:44:18.489 --> 00:44:21.367
At least To Hee.

539
00:44:21.450 --> 00:44:23.577
you don't care

540
00:44:24.495 --> 00:44:25.913
how do i know about you

541
00:44:26.830 --> 00:44:29.625
Extraordinary aura and strange speech.

542
00:44:29.708 --> 00:44:30.793
as soon as i saw you

543
00:44:31.794 --> 00:44:34.630
i knew you were the devil

544
00:44:35.255 --> 00:44:36.590
that Ms. Chu was talking about.

545
00:44:40.177 --> 00:44:42.638
Are you saying Choo Jung-suk saw me?

546
00:44:42.721 --> 00:44:45.974
She was present

547
00:44:47.142 --> 00:44:48.477
when you were driving

548
00:44:49.645 --> 00:44:51.105
To Hee's father to hell.

549
00:44:54.316 --> 00:44:56.193
<i>You can't make a wish.</i>

550
00:44:56.693 --> 00:44:58.862
You are ten years ago
already made a deal with me.

